comments.body:
This case catches the `>= 34` mutant: it passes unmutated and fails with the mutant.

```suggestion
    BOOST_CHECK(!CScript(bytes.begin(), bytes.end()).IsPayToTaproot());

    // 35 bytes starting with OP_1 0x20
    bytes = {OP_1, 0x20};
    bytes.insert(bytes.end(), 33, 0);
    BOOST_CHECK(!CScript(bytes.begin(), bytes.end()).IsPayToTaproot());
```

